<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">SOTA comparison on Llama 3.2-Vision instruction 11B with weight 1 to 1.1 bit<span id="S4.T4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. For the language model part, our Bi-VLM outperforms the SOTA by 4%-47%. For the overall VLM, our Bi-VLM outperforms the SOTA by 8%-45%. FP: Full precision. L: Language model, all: the whole VLM model.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
