</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S4.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">SOTA comparison on Llava-One-Vision 7B with weight 1 to 1.1 bit<span id="S4.T5.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. For the language model part, our Bi-VLM outperforms the SOTA by 3%-20%. For the overall VLM, our Bi-VLM outperforms the SOTA by 4%-19%. FP: Full precision. L: Language model, all: the whole VLM model.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
